    "Is there a demand limit or target number of complete products to produce, or should the model simply produce as many complete products as the workshop capacities allow?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding production targets versus capacity maximization, which constitutes one semantically independent question."
}

